%% TMS — Deployment diagram
%% Effective production components may advance independently in a monorepo.
flowchart TB
    GH["GitHub\nRepository + CI"]
    VercelWeb["Vercel\ntms-web"]
    VercelAPI["Vercel\ntms-core-api"]
    Railway["Railway\ntms-worker / backup worker"]
    Auth0["Auth0\nTenant-aware OIDC"]
    Neon["Neon PostgreSQL\nProduction branch"]
    S3["S3-compatible object store\nBackup artifacts"]
    User["Browser / Operator"]

    GH -->|Build / deploy web| VercelWeb
    GH -->|Build / deploy API| VercelAPI
    GH -->|Build / deploy worker| Railway

    User -->|HTTPS| VercelWeb
    VercelWeb -->|OIDC / API access token| Auth0
    VercelWeb -->|HTTPS API| VercelAPI
    VercelAPI -->|JWT verification| Auth0
    VercelAPI -->|PostgreSQL TLS| Neon
    Railway -->|PostgreSQL TLS| Neon
    Railway -->|Encrypted backup| S3

    subgraph ReleaseControl["Release control"]
      Manifest["Versioned release manifest\nGit SHA + effective component SHAs + migration head"]
      DocsCheck["Architecture documentation check\nCI verifies diagram set + index links"]
    end

    GH --> Manifest
    GH --> DocsCheck
